SERVERS: maps .rs to rust-analyzer and .go to gopls
serverFor: lets the config entry for an extension win over SERVERS
ensureServer: uses a server on PATH only when it exits 0 for --version
ensureServer: downloads a GitHub release asset and gunzips it into SERVER_DIR
MAX_AGE_MS: is seven days
flatten: skips symbols whose names contain parentheses or angle brackets
startServer: throws when the server's capabilities have no documentSymbolProvider
indexFiles: tries at most five discovered candidates per extension
indexFiles: rejects a discovered server that lists no symbols in any file
